task_text:
Compare the price of this product including shipping on these shops: {product}
Open each product page below, one site at a time, and confirm it is the same product (model SM58-LC, new condition):
{sites}
On each page read the product title as shown, the price, and the shipping information shown on the product page (a banner, a note near the price, or a shipping/delivery tab you can open on the same page). Shipping cost 0 if the page says shipping is free for this item; null if the page does not state it. Do not open the cart or checkout to find out. Close a cookie banner or pop-up if it covers the page (decline optional cookies). Report one result per shop with the product page URL. Then call done.
